Requirements For Face Detection

Python Version	:	8 or 9
--------------------

Modules Required
----------------------
cmake
dlib
face_recognition
numpy==1.26
pandas
matplotlib
scikit-learn
opencv-python

To install write

 "pip install <module name> "
_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

If Dlib is not being installed
-----------------------------------
1. Download it
	From : "https://github.com/sachadee/Dlib/tree/main"
			Or
	GTB Website -> Notes Section ->
	For python 3.9		=>		dlib-19.22.99-cp39-cp39-win_amd64.whl       [used in my project]
	For python 3.8		=>		dlib-19.22.99-cp38-cp38-win_amd64.whl

	copy & paste  any of this in your project

2. Open Terminal and write command
		"python -m pip install dlib-19.22.99-cp39-cp39-win_amd64.whl"